### Circuit Breaker Test Endpoints

### 1. Check initial status (Circuit should be CLOSED)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/status

###

### 2. Make successful call (No failures yet)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/user-service/1

###

### 3. Enable failure simulation (All calls will fail)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/simulate-failure/enable

###

### 4. Make call 1 (Fails)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/user-service/1

###

### 5. Make call 2 (Fails)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/user-service/2

###

### 6. Make call 3 (Fails)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/user-service/3

###

### 7. Make call 4 (Fails)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/user-service/4

###

### 8. Make call 5 (Fails - Circuit should OPEN now)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/user-service/5

###

### 9. Check status (Circuit should be OPEN)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/status

###

### 10. Try call while OPEN (Should fail immediately)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/user-service/1

###

### 11. Disable failure simulation (Allow recovery)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/simulate-failure/disable

###

### 12. Wait 10 seconds, then check status (Circuit should be HALF_OPEN)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/status

###

### 13. Make test call in HALF_OPEN state (Success)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/user-service/1

###

### 14. Check status (Circuit should be CLOSED again)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/status

###

### 15. Get detailed metrics
GET http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/metrics

###

### 16. Reset all circuit breakers
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/circuit-breaker-test/reset

###

### 17. Check Actuator Health (includes circuit breaker status)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/actuator/health

###

### 18. Check Actuator Metrics
GET http://localhost:8083/api/actuator/metrics

